  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your deadly fighting style makes your limbs like a whirlwind of knives.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Hamatulatsu Strike<sup>ISWG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your unarmed strikes deal may bludgeoning damage, piercing damage, or both simultaneously, and the duration of the sickened or staggered condition caused by your critical hits stacks with itself and other sources of becoming sickened or staggered.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc162\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
